---
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
import SloganBlock from '../components/SloganBlock.astro';
import Photo from '../components/Photo.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import { SITE, STATS } from '../lib/site';

const team = (await getCollection('team')).sort((a, b) => a.data.order - b.data.order);
const partners = (await getCollection('partners')).sort((a, b) => a.data.order - b.data.order);
const chapters = (await getCollection('chapters')).filter((c) => c.data.status === 'active').sort((a, b) => a.data.order - b.data.order);
---
<Base title="About" description="Founded in 2018 by four students at Cayman International School, POF is now the largest youth-led environmental advocacy group in the Cayman Islands.">
  <Hero compact eyebrow="About" title="Started by four students in 2018. Run by about 180 today.">
    <p class="lede">Protect Our Future began as a campaign against overdevelopment. It is now the largest youth-led environmental advocacy group in the Cayman Islands.</p>
  </Hero>

  <section class="section surface-paper">
    <div class="container grid">
      <div class="story__media reveal">
        <Photo aspect="4 / 5" aspectDesktop="3 / 4" tone="mangrove" sizes="(min-width: 64em) 40vw, 100vw" />
      </div>
      <div class="story__copy flow reveal" style="--i: 1">
        <h2>The story</h2>
        <p>In 2018, four students at Cayman International School decided that the adults planning the islands' future were not going to be the only voices in the room. They painted slogans on white bedsheets, took them to public meetings, and called the group Protect Our Future.</p>
        <p>The first fight was cruise berthing in George Town Harbour. It lasted seven years. On 30 April 2025, the Cayman Islands voted in a referendum: 11,993 people, 63.66%, said no.</p>
        <p>Along the way, members took the islands' case to the UN climate conferences at COP25 in Spain, COP26 in Glasgow, COP27 in Egypt and COP28 in the United Arab Emirates. In March 2024, member Dejea Lyons became the first Caymanian to receive the Diana Legacy Award, presented by Prince William.</p>
        <SloganBlock as="p" size="md">Ignorance decides our future</SloganBlock>
        <p>That line is painted on one of the original banners. It is why POF puts as much work into teaching as into campaigning.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section surface-sand" aria-labelledby="work-heading">
    <div class="container grid">
      <div class="work__lead">
        <h2 id="work-heading">Three areas of work</h2>
      </div>
      <ol class="work__list" role="list">
        <li class="reveal">
          <span class="work__num tnum" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
          <h3>Protecting natural habitats through legislation</h3>
          <p>POF submits formal letters when the law is reopened. It has written on the National Conservation Act amendments and on the National Energy Policy.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="reveal" style="--i: 1">
          <span class="work__num tnum" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
          <h3>Educating the public on behaviour</h3>
          <p>Reef-safe sunscreen, single-use plastic, where the sand goes. Most of the change POF asks for is a habit, and habits change when people understand why.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="reveal" style="--i: 2">
          <span class="work__num tnum" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
          <h3>Sustainable development</h3>
          <p>The islands will keep building. POF argues for building that leaves the mangroves, the reef and Seven Mile Beach intact for the people who inherit them.</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
      <p class="work__link"><a href="/our-work">See every campaign and its status <Icon name="arrow-right" class="inline-icon" /></a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section surface-paper" aria-labelledby="team-heading">
    <div class="container grid">
      <div class="team__lead flow">
        <h2 id="team-heading">Who runs it</h2>
        <p>Students graduate every year, so POF is organised by role. Each role has a job description that stays the same and a student who changes. The current holder's name sits under the role once each year's roster is confirmed.</p>
        <p class="meta">Roster updated each school term by the President.</p>
      </div>
      <dl class="team__list">
        {team.map((t, i) => (
          <div class="team__role reveal" style={`--i: ${i}`}>
            <dt>{t.data.role}</dt>
            <dd>
              <p class="team__holder">{t.data.holder ? `${t.data.holder}${t.data.school ? `, ${t.data.school}` : ''}` : 'Current holder to be named for this school year.'}</p>
              <p class="muted">{t.data.responsibility}</p>
            </dd>
          </div>
        ))}
      </dl>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section surface-sand" aria-labelledby="chapters-heading">
    <div class="container grid">
      <div class="chapters__lead flow">
        <h2 id="chapters-heading">Four school chapters</h2>
        <p>Generation Green is POF's programme for official student-led chapters in schools. Around 180 students are active across these four.</p>
        <p><a href="/generation-green">How chapters work, and how to start one <Icon name="arrow-right" class="inline-icon" /></a></p>
      </div>
      <ul class="chapters__list" role="list">
        {chapters.map((c) => <li>{c.data.school}</li>)}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section surface-paper" aria-labelledby="partners-heading">
    <div class="container grid">
      <div class="partners__lead flow">
        <h2 id="partners-heading">Partners</h2>
        <p>POF works alongside the organisations below. Sustainable Cayman, a registered non-profit ({SITE.fiscalPartner.npo}), receives donations on POF's behalf.</p>
      </div>
      <ul class="partners__list" role="list">
        {partners.map((p) => (
          <li>
            {p.data.url ? <a href={p.data.url} rel="noopener">{p.data.name}</a> : <span>{p.data.name}</span>}
            {p.data.note && <span class="meta partners__note">{p.data.note}</span>}
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section surface-ocean" aria-labelledby="numbers-heading">
    <div class="container grid">
      <div class="numbers__lead flow">
        <h2 id="numbers-heading">The numbers, with sources</h2>
        <p>Every figure POF uses in public, and where it comes from. Updated once a year or when a figure changes.</p>
      </div>
      <dl class="numbers__list">
        {STATS.map((s) => (
          <div class="numbers__row">
            <dt><span class="tnum numbers__value">{s.value}</span> {s.label}</dt>
            <dd class="meta">{s.source}</dd>
          </div>
        ))}
        <div class="numbers__row">
          <dt>First Caymanian to receive the Diana Legacy Award</dt>
          <dd class="meta">Dejea Lyons, March 2024, presented by Prince William</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="numbers__row">
          <dt>Four UN climate conferences</dt>
          <dd class="meta">COP25 Spain, COP26 Glasgow, COP27 Egypt, COP28 UAE</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
<style>
  .story__media, .story__copy, .work__lead, .work__list, .work__link, .team__lead, .team__list, .chapters__lead, .chapters__list, .partners__lead, .partners__list, .numbers__lead, .numbers__list { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
  .story__media { margin-inline: calc(-1 * var(--gutter)); }
  .work__list { display: grid; gap: var(--s-5); counter-reset: work; }
  .work__list li { display: grid; gap: var(--s-2); padding-top: var(--s-3); border-top: 1px solid var(--c-ink); }
  .work__num { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700; font-size: var(--fs-2); color: var(--text-muted); }
  .team__list { display: grid; gap: var(--s-4); }
  .team__role { display: grid; gap: var(--s-2); padding-top: var(--s-3); border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); }
  .team__role dt { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 600; font-size: var(--fs-2); }
  .team__holder { font-family: var(--font-display); }
  .chapters__list { display: grid; gap: var(--s-2); font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: var(--fs-2); font-weight: 600; }
  .chapters__list li { padding-block: var(--s-2); border-top: 1px solid var(--c-ink); }
  .partners__list { display: grid; gap: var(--s-2); }
  .partners__list li { display: grid; padding-block: var(--s-2); border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); font-family: var(--font-display); }
  .partners__list a { min-height: var(--touch); display: inline-flex; align-items: center; }
  .numbers__list { display: grid; gap: var(--s-3); }
  .numbers__row { display: grid; gap: var(--s-1); padding-top: var(--s-3); border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); }
  .numbers__row dt { font-family: var(--font-display); }
  .numbers__value { font-weight: 700; }
  :global(.inline-icon) { display: inline; vertical-align: -0.2em; width: 1em; height: 1em; }
  @media (min-width: 64em) {
    .story__media { grid-column: 1 / 6; margin-inline: 0; }
    .story__copy { grid-column: 7 / 13; }
    .work__lead { grid-column: 1 / 4; }
    .work__list { grid-column: 5 / 13; }
    .work__link { grid-column: 5 / 13; }
    .team__lead { grid-column: 1 / 5; }
    .team__list { grid-column: 6 / 13; }
    .chapters__lead { grid-column: 8 / 13; grid-row: 1; }
    .chapters__list { grid-column: 1 / 7; grid-row: 1; }
    .partners__lead { grid-column: 1 / 5; }
    .partners__list { grid-column: 6 / 13; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; column-gap: var(--s-5); }
    .numbers__lead { grid-column: 1 / 5; }
    .numbers__list { grid-column: 6 / 13; }
  }
</style>
